# SPA routing + deploy-race protection.
#
# Rule 1 protects the deploy race: when new HTML references a hashed asset that
# has not propagated yet, serving index.html at that asset URL would get cached
# under the JS URL -> blank page. Return a 404 instead so the module load fails
# cleanly (the inline self-heal script reloads once).
#
# NOTE: a top-level 404.html DISABLES Pages' SPA mode (see Cloudflare docs
# "Serving Pages"), so we must NOT ship one. Asset 404s use index.html as the
# body with a 404 status instead.
/assets/*    /index.html    404
/*           /index.html    200
